[68.641222, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[68.683936, "o", "[HIGH  ] M14-12 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.4)\u001b[m\u001b[K tsg-web-frontend may invoke the tools Lambda directly: that path skips the gateway's authorizer and policy engine\r\n[HIGH  ] M14-13 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.4)\u001b[m\u001b[K the agent calls the gateway with its own client-credentials token: every tool call looks like the agent, so the gateway policy can't tell Bob from Alice\r\n[MEDIUM] M14-14 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.4)\u001b[m\u001b[K the gateway role has lambda:InvokeFunction on '*': its permissions are the upper bound for every caller of every target\r\n[LOW   ] M14-15 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.4)\u001b[m\u001b[K exceptionLevel DEBUG: detailed error messages go back to callers; turn it off outside development\r\n"]
