[107.221977, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[107.265604, "o", "[HIGH  ] M14-16 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.5)\u001b[m\u001b[K the policy engine is attached in LOG_ONLY mode: every tool call succeeds regardless of forbid policies\r\n[HIGH  ] M14-17 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.5)\u001b[m\u001b[K the Cedar policies ALLOW: Bob resets the CEO's MFA naming the CEO as caller\r\n[HIGH  ] M14-18 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.5)\u001b[m\u001b[K tsg-web-frontend may call UpdateGateway: that permission alone can set the mode to LOG_ONLY or remove the policy engine\r\n[MEDIUM] M14-19 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.5)\u001b[m\u001b[K the temporal limit counts per policy session, and the browser chooses the session ID: a new ID is a new count\r\n[MEDIUM] M14-20 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.5)\u001b[m\u001b[K send_email is allowed to addresses outside example.com: an injected instruction can mail data out (challenge 1)\r\n"]
