[156.833102, "o", "[HIGH  ] M14-21 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.6)\u001b[m\u001b[K long-term memory namespace /helpdesk/facts/ has no {actorId}: what one user teaches the agent, every user gets back\r\n[HIGH  ] M14-22 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.6)\u001b[m\u001b[K the agent takes the memory actorId from the request: a user can read or write another user's memories\r\n[HIGH  ] M14-24 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.6)\u001b[m\u001b[K a Code Interpreter (PUBLIC network, with an execution role) the task does not need: even SANDBOX mode can reach Amazon S3 and resolve DNS\r\n[MEDIUM] M14-23 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.6)\u001b[m\u001b[K memory writes are not validated: text the agent read in a tool result can become a long-term memory (challenge 2)\r\n"]
