[230.187008, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[230.230188, "o", "[MEDIUM] M14-26 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.7)\u001b[m\u001b[K CloudTrail does not log data events for AWS::BedrockAgentCore::Gateway, AWS::BedrockAgentCore::Memory, AWS::BedrockAgentCore::Runtime, AWS::BedrockAgentCore::TokenVault: trails don't log data events by default\r\n[MEDIUM] M14-27 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.7)\u001b[m\u001b[K gateway tracing (and CloudWatch Transaction Search) is off: no spans with the policy decision, determining policies and mode\r\n[LOW   ] M14-28 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K(14.7)\u001b[m\u001b[K no online evaluation configuration: nobody samples production traces for quality or safety drift\r\n"]
